### Time & Space Complexity

- Time complexity:
    - $O(1)$ time for initialization.
    - $O(1)$ time for each $push()$ and $empty()$ function calls.
    - $O(1)$ amortized time for each $pop()$ and $peek()$ function calls.
- Space complexity: $O(n)$

